        <activityName xml:lang="en">Methane, from electrochemical methanation, with carbon from atmospheric CO2 capture, hydrogen from autonomo [4530fc729c]</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Methane, from electrochemical methanation, with carbon from atmospheric CO2 capture, hydrogen from autonomous hybrid plant
Originally in cubic meter. Composition: 96% CH4, 4% CO2, Density of synthetic methane: 0.72 kg/Nm3, LHV ~47.5 MJ/kg. Using the "CO2 methanation - sewage sludge - PSA - worst - BFB_FB" configuration. Source: Life cycle assessment of power-to-gas with biogas as the carbon source. Xiaojin Zhang, Julia Witte, Tilman Schildhauer and Christian Bauer. https://doi.org/10.1/C9SE00986H Source: Life cycle assessment of power-to-gas with biogas as the carbon source. Xiaojin Zhang, Julia Witte, Tilman Schildhauer and Christian Bauer. https://doi.org/10.1039/C9SE00986H

